# The qits CLI binary, fetched into the build context before `buildctl build` and COPYed by the
# Dockerfile. It is NOT source: it is a released artifact of qits-platform-access-cli, ~42 MB of
# native binary, and the only committed statement about it is `pom.xml`'s one
# `<qits.platform-access-cli-binary.version>` line. Both CI recipes write it here, and so does anybody
# following README.md's "Building by hand" — so without this line the next `git add -A` in a workspace
# quietly stages 42 MB of downloaded binary into the history of an image recipe, under a name that
# would then shadow the fetch on every later build.
/qits

# `./mvnw verify` resolves the CLI pin and writes an empty jar here. Nothing in it is an input to the
# image; the maven step exists so that a pin naming a jar that does not resolve fails loudly.
target/
